<p>We process account, organization, and transaction data to deliver procurement workflows. Tenant data is scoped by <code>organization_id</code> and protected with role-based access control.</p>
<p>Security Center features support IP allow-lists, session review, and GDPR export/delete requests. Audit logs record impersonation and sensitive admin actions.</p>
<p>Payment gateway credentials stay in environment configuration; adapters never log full card or wallet secrets. File uploads are validated and can hook into virus scanning.</p>
